Appendix F — Reference Monitor Model

F.1 PEP as Reference Monitor

Definition F.1 (PEP). The PEP is a function

\mathrm{PEP} : \text{Requests} \times \text{Policies} \times \mathcal{S} \to \text{Decisions}

where $\text{Decisions} = \{\mathrm{Allow}, \mathrm{Deny}\}$.

